{"id":1191630,"shortDescription":"Shantae regresa con una nueva aventura tropical. En su quinta aventura, la heroína medio-genio usa sus habilidades mágicas de fusión para explorar una enorme ciudad sumergida. Shantae hace nuevas amigas medio-genio y lucha contra las siete ninfas en su misión más importante y emocionante hasta el momento.","developers":["WayForward"],"publishers":["WayForward"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"28 MAY 2020","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1191630?t=1717695728","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191630/ss_86e246d7ba9ba18ce9783d69212559a925fa42d5.600x338.jpg?t=1717695728","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191630/ss_86e246d7ba9ba18ce9783d69212559a925fa42d5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1717695728"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191630/ss_09fb3f5caf2db9ed5487c927946181e458943d4b.600x338.jpg?t=1717695728","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191630/ss_09fb3f5caf2db9ed5487c927946181e458943d4b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1717695728"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191630/ss_962850479967aef8b26c864445740c50e1f47a62.600x338.jpg?t=1717695728","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191630/ss_962850479967aef8b26c864445740c50e1f47a62.1920x1080.jpg?t=1717695728"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191630/ss_f177e3821603d8461540a9b393d877e61a3504de.600x338.jpg?t=1717695728","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191630/ss_f177e3821603d8461540a9b393d877e61a3504de.1920x1080.jpg?t=1717695728"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191630/ss_7ecda6366e8117